dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135604425,imgsize-102730.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Watch: Karmabhoomi Express coaches gutted in Punjab; short-circuit suspected]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-karmabhoomi-express-coaches-gutted-in-punjab-short-circuit-suspected/articleshow/135602316.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135602316.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[A fire erupted in three coaches of the Karmabhoomi Express in Patiala district, Punjab on Friday around 1pm. The sudden flames instilled fear in passengers as they spread quickly. Promptly, railway officials and emergency teams arrived to manage the situation, which was likely caused by a short circuit. Fortunately, all passengers were unharmed, and alternative transportation was arranged for their continued journey.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-karmabhoomi-express-coaches-gutted-in-punjab-short-circuit-suspected/articleshow/135602316.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-karmabhoomi-express-coaches-gutted-in-punjab-short-circuit-suspected/articleshow/135602316.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-06T15:32:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135602903,imgsize-14945861.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SC ends decades-old power tussle, Himachal to get 11,973 MU from Punjab, Haryana]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-ends-decades-old-power-tussle-himachal-to-get-11973-mu-from-punjab-haryana/articleshow/135600859.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;